# maluos-desktop: the MaluOS workstation. GNOME 50 with Ubuntu's session
# extensions and the Yaru look, no snaps: Firefox comes as a deb from
# Mozilla's repository (maluos-archive-mozilla) and GNOME Software runs
# with the deb plugin only. No Ubuntu-branded update or reporting tools;
# updates are unattended-upgrades (maluos-base), GNOME Software and
# `maluctl update`. Pair it with maluos-server (image/profiles/desktop.pkgs
# does) for a local memory host.
maluos-base
maluos-desktop-branding
maluos-desktop-session
# the desk's enrolment with a Business OS office (maluctl office)
maluos-desk
# session and shell
gdm3
gnome-shell
ubuntu-session
